Hey cephers,

A while ago I sent out a note to let people know that Red Hat and
Intel will be partnering to host a real 4-day hackathon at Intel's
offices in Hilsboro, OR on Aug 10-13.  Our goal is to keep this a
small (20-25 max) gathering of people doing real work. Right now the
focus is on performance work and maybe some RGW or RBD work thrown in
for good measure.

If you are interested in attending please make sure that your name is
on the list on the etherpad at:

http://pad.ceph.com/p/hackathon_2015-08

If you have any questions in the meantime, feel free to reach out to
me directly. Thanks.


